            "review_title": "Review at Omakase K",
            "review_text": "SaigonExile\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam166 contributions\n0\nA Gem of A Find\nJan 2025 • Couples\nWhat a gem of a find. If anyone has experienced an authentic sushi restaurant in Japan, then this will a reminder of how much fun, and good, it is.\n\nMy wife and I had a sitting at 6pm (only 12 seats I believe) and it lasted for two glorious hours. Everything from simple sushi to puffer fish and baby eels (both a first for me). We finished with passion fruit ice cream.\n\nThe service was spot on and the chef a master at his craft. Thank you to the staff and especially to the chef. We will be back!!\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nMake your reservation and be on time. They will ask if you have any allergies. Just enjoy!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten January 26, 2025",
